01:02:16.660 --> 01:02:22.760
<v Dana Chivvis>The grape smuggler, the Miami meat tent, the dingaling sling, the Saint-Tropez truffle duffle.
<v Dana Chivvis>那个葡萄偷运者，迈阿密肉块帐篷，晃动吊带，圣特罗佩松露袋。

01:02:22.760 --> 01:02:27.760
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Don't forget the sunscreen. I'll be back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。别忘了防晒霜。下周我会带着《美国生活》的更多故事回来。
